Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.03,0:00:06.03,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1911.111,230.741)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:14.88,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1834.371,1895.407)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N！！真的有人看不到这行字！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:20.74,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1948.149,255.852)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:28.91,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1878.075,316.889)}♥本视频在Enderman频道会员有效期内翻译♥
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你是否对家里的公网IP感到不满？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Are you unsatisfied with your public IP address at home?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.16,0:00:09.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是否因为大公司霸占着最酷的子网段而陷入存在主义危机？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.16,0:00:09.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Do you have an existential crisis because the biggest corporations own the coolest subnets?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.46,0:00:14.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,小心了 你可能都没意识到自家子网里的IP地址其实超带感！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.46,0:00:14.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Beware, you might not even realize that your IP address on your subnet actually SLAPS.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.94,0:00:21.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,本期视频将彻底改变你的人生 给你那糟糕的公网IP一个应得的逆袭机会 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.94,0:00:21.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is the video that'll turn your life around and give your horrible public IP the second chance it deserves.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.50,0:00:22.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,绝对靠谱！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.50,0:00:22.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.80,0:00:23.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.80,0:00:23.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.22,0:00:32.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,告诉你吧 缩略图里那个IP地址是10亿零1 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.22,0:00:32.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you, the IP address you saw in the thumbnail is 1 billion and 1,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.38,0:00:34.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它上面那个是100亿零1 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.38,0:00:34.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the IP address above it is 10 billion and 1,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.06,0:00:37.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,下面那个则是1亿零1 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.06,0:00:37.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and the IP below it is 100 million and 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.82,0:00:39.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么意思呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.82,0:00:39.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What exactly do I mean by this?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,IP地址实际上是一个整数  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The IP address is actually an integer,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.70,0:00:42.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,更准确地说  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.70,0:00:42.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and to be more precise,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它是一个32位整数  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's a 32-bit integer.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.30,0:00:49.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这意味着全球总共只有约40亿个IP地址  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.30,0:00:49.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Which means there are only approximately 4 billion IP addresses in total.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.84,0:00:53.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们需要网络地址转换（NAT）和本地子网  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.84,0:00:53.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is why we have network address translation and local subnets,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.82,0:00:57.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为地球上的设备显然超过40亿台  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.82,0:00:57.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because there are clearly more than 4 billion devices on planet earth,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.90,0:01:00.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们必须通过某种方式在网络上识别它们  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.90,0:01:00.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and we need to identify them online somehow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.88,0:01:04.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这也解释了为何理论上可以用数字表示IP地址  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.88,0:01:04.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is also why you can theoretically express the IP address as a number,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.26,0:01:08.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你甚至可以按顺序写下所有IP  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.26,0:01:08.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and moreover, you can also write all of them down sequentially,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.50,0:01:13.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1934.815,1732.963)}从1数到40多亿就能穷尽所有可能的地址
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.50,0:01:13.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and you can count to 4 billion and something and essentially list every single IP address out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:13.79,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1911.111,2024.444)}你手指头够多时才能数到四十亿
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.88,0:01:16.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些点号仅为方便而设   
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.88,0:01:16.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The dots are there for convenience sake only,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:38.24,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1922.962,382.963)}八位组
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.78,0:01:19.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它们分隔所谓的“八位组”即字节
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.78,0:01:19.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,they separate so-called octets,or bytes, 
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.04,0:01:24.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,本质上将32位数划分为4个等长的8位部分   
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.04,0:01:24.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,basically dividing a 32-bit number into 4 equal 8-bit parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:26.31,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1896.296,1417.037)}每个八位组为一个字节（8比特），IP地址的整数值是通过按位连接得出的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:26.31,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1813.333,1873.333)}“和” 运算符分别表示左移和右移
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.14,0:01:30.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,最大的8位数字是2的8次方即256
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.14,0:01:30.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The largest 8-bit number is 2 to the power of 8,or 256.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.58,0:01:32.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是8位数字的总数量   
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.58,0:01:32.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's how many 8-bit numbers there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:37.68,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1831.111,1837.777)}8位只能表示256个数字的原因在于，每个位仅有2种状态且共有8个这样的位
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,若包含零 最大值则为255   
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If we include zero, the maximum number will become 255.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.74,0:01:42.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1943.704,1812.964)}这就是为什么IP地址各段数值不能超过255   
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.74,0:01:42.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is why the IP address octets cannot be larger than 255.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:42.44,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1958.518,2015.555)}这个梗总是让我尴尬，因为那根本不是IPv4地址...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实际应用中 IP地址始终会被转换为整数   
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,In reality, it's always translated to an integer,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.78,0:01:50.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这意味着我们总能通过提供整数值来访问IP地址 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.78,0:01:50.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which means we can always access the IP addresses by supplying their integer values.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这适用于浏览器  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This works in browsers,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.54,0:01:54.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,控制台及其他所有场景  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:52.54,0:01:54.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,in consoles, and everything else.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.34,0:01:58.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这意味着Cloudflare的1.1.1.1 IP地址其实很糟糕  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:55.34,0:01:58.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That means the Cloudflare Quad-1 IP sucks,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.42,0:02:03.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为其实际整数值是16,843,009  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.42,0:02:03.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because in reality it's 16,843,009.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:04.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这确实不够直观  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.56,0:02:04.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.48,0:02:07.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,用十六进制表示会稍好一些  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.48,0:02:07.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It does look better in hexadecimal,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.50,0:02:10.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为每两个十六进制字符代表一个字节  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.50,0:02:10.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because every two hexadecimal characters represent a byte,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.76,0:02:12.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而IP地址分段正是字节为单位  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.76,0:02:12.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and the octets are bytes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但谁会用十六进制来计数呢？  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Who counts in hexadecimal though?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.56,0:02:17.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1931.852,1629.259)}人类普遍使用十进制系统
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.56,0:02:17.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Humans use the decimal system,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:22.91,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1917.036,2021.481)}不过我的确以十进制计数。真不明白为什么我们不直接改用十二进制，它实在优越太多了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.74,0:02:23.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1952.593,1641.111)}所以从定义上来说 最美的IP地址应该是十进制中1后面跟着一串零  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:17.74,0:02:23.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so the most beautiful IP address by definition are 1 followed by many zeros in decimal.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但遗憾的是 这样总会得到一个子网地址  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that will always result in a subnet,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.18,0:02:30.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1917.037,1620.37)}因为最后8位比特在这种情况下永远为零  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.18,0:02:30.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because the last 8 bits will always be zero in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:34.59,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1943.703,584.444)}还有一个有趣的事实是，这种特性仅在数值达到1亿时才开始出现，\N这也是首个符合该条件的有效IP地址。此时十进制系统在最后8位二进制数上\N终于追平了十六进制，因为十进制比十六进制少了6个额外数字
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.42,0:02:34.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1917.037,1611.481)}于是我们取该子网的第一个IP视作美观地址  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:30.42,0:02:34.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we'll take the first IP from that subnet and consider it beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.12,0:02:38.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过刚才说的所有内容里存在一个小矛盾  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.12,0:02:38.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There is a little contradiction in everything I said though.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.56,0:02:39.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不知各位是否察觉  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.56,0:02:39.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you've noticed it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.44,0:02:43.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,既然IPv4只有40亿个地址  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.44,0:02:43.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If there are only 4 billion IPv4 addresses,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.54,0:02:45.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,怎会出现十亿零一的地址？  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.54,0:02:45.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,then how is one of them 10 billion and one?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,若能发现这一点  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If you've noticed that,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,恭喜 你真是个行家  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,congrats, you're a legend.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.16,0:02:51.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,原因其实很简单  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.16,0:02:51.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now the reasoning is simple.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.06,0:02:53.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我是Windows阵营的  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:52.06,0:02:53.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm a Windows guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,专注制作Windows相关内容  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I make content about Windows.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.94,0:02:59.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而Windows是完美无瑕的操作系统 绝无任何漏洞  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.94,0:02:59.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And Windows is a great operating system without any bugs whatsoever.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.88,0:03:09.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这里出现十亿级IP的原因是...是...整数溢出！  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:01.88,0:03:09.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What took place for that IP address to become 10 billion here is... is... an integer overflow!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.48,0:03:11.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错！  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.48,0:03:11.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.72,0:03:14.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我在构思视频时偶然发现了这个问题  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.72,0:03:14.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I accidentally discovered that when working on a premise for this video,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.04,0:03:18.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不得不搬出反汇编工具一探究竟  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.04,0:03:18.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so I had to whip out a disassembler to see what's going on there.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.66,0:03:24.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,快速分析发现ping.exe调用了RtlIPv4StringToAddressW函数  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.66,0:03:24.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,A quick analysis uncovered ping.exe calling the RtlIPv4StringToAddressW function.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.54,0:03:27.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,W代表宽字符  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:25.54,0:03:27.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,W means wide character.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是的 Windows钟情UTF-16编码  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yes, Windows loves UTF-16.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.56,0:03:35.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,经过逆向工程 我找到了整数溢出的发生点  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.56,0:03:35.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So then I reverse engineered it and found where the integer overflow occurs.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,虽无实际危害  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.50,0:03:37.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's significant,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.94,0:03:39.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,无法被利用  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.94,0:03:39.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you can't exploit that.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.46,0:03:40.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但更有趣的是  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.46,0:03:40.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,More interestingly though,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.84,0:03:43.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我发现每个八位组都是独立处理的  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:40.84,0:03:43.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I discovered that every octet is processed separately,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.20,0:03:48.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这使得史上最诡异的地址也能被ping通  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:44.20,0:03:48.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,enabling one of the most unholy addresses I've ever seen to get pinged.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.56,0:03:54.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而且你甚至不需要凑满4个八位组  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.56,0:03:54.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And you don't even need 4 octets to complete the IP address,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.12,0:03:57.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,除非严格模式参数被启用  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.12,0:03:57.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,unless the strict argument is set to true,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但事实上这个参数从来不会被启用
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which it isn't, ever.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.44,0:04:01.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这设计简直令人发指  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.44,0:04:01.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Which makes it even more disgusting.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.46,0:04:05.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不止支持十六进制和十进制  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.46,0:04:05.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not just hexadecimal and decimal.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.70,0:04:07.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,八进制同样可行  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.70,0:04:07.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The erratics can be 8 too,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.46,0:04:08.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,完全遵循C语言规范  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.46,0:04:08.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it's all C-like.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.12,0:04:11.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,想用八进制表示法？  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.12,0:04:11.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Basically, if you want to use the octal system,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在数字前加个零就行  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,just prepend a zero before the number.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.41,0:04:16.89,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\i1}屁大点事谁在乎？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.41,0:04:16.89,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh my god, who the hell cares?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.02,0:04:23.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1934.815,1753.704)}天知道 我花了好久反编译Windows的ping程序  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.02,0:04:23.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I just spent time reversing ping from Windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:24.13,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1955.555,2009.629)}显然，那些不规范的IP地址在Linux和MacOS系统上同样有效
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,理论上来说  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Anyways, theoretically,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.72,0:04:26.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1958.518,1691.481)}借助整数溢出  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.72,0:04:26.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,with an integer overflow,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.18,0:04:29.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1943.704,1694.444)}每个子网IP都能变得很美妙  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.18,0:04:29.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,every subnet IP is beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.94,0:04:32.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1934.815,1694.444)}但我至今没搞清它的生效机制  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.94,0:04:32.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But I still have no clue when it works and when it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:31.26,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs100\pos(1887.407,2045.185)}除了仅在Windows上存在的溢出漏洞外，任何使用RtlIpv4StringToAddressW()的代码都可能受其影响
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.24,0:04:35.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,说实话也懒得深究  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.24,0:04:35.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And to be fair, I don't really care to dig deeper.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,只有两个真正绝妙的IP  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There are only 2 truly beautiful IPs,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.66,0:04:40.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,一亿和十亿  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.66,0:04:40.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,100 million and 1 billion.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.38,0:04:44.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,百亿级需要整数溢出才能生效  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.38,0:04:44.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,10 billion will only work with an integer overflow,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.44,0:04:48.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而千万级还不够填充第一个高位八位组  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:44.44,0:04:48.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and 10 million isn't enough to fill in the first high-order octet.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,值得提名的？  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Honorable mentions?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.98,0:04:51.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,1到9的每个数字  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.98,0:04:51.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Every digit from 1 to 9,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,都是合法IP地址  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,that is a valid IP address,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.48,0:04:54.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但我ping不通  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.48,0:04:54.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but I can't ping it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.06,0:04:56.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,估计是关了ICMP协议  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.06,0:04:56.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Probably has ICMP turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:05:01.93,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(2219.259,1861.482)}*ICMP（Internet Control Message Protocol）Internet控制报文协议\N控制消息是指网络通不通、主机是否可达、路由是否可用等网络本身的消息*
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,另一个能ping通的  
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Another one, which I can ping,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是0到9的每个数字  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,is every digit from 0 to 9.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,要是你拥有这类IP或子网  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If you own that IP address or a subnet,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,恭喜中奖咯  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,well, congrats I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,转手就能卖两百亿美金  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Time to sell it for 20 billion dollars.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.46,0:05:13.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,还记什么八位组啊  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.46,0:05:13.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Forget remembering the octets,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1946.667,1694.444)}说不定有更优雅的IP表示法  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,there might be an even better representation of your IP address.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.46,0:05:20.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1946.667,1694.444)}都能直接操作十进制IP了 谁还需要DNS？  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.46,0:05:20.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Who needs DNS when we can just raw-dock decimal IPs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.41,0:05:20.18,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1955.555,2060)}查看描述即可了解你的IP地址是否超棒！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.36,0:05:22.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这简直太酷了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.36,0:05:22.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I think that's awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.32,0:05:26.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这才值得庆祝 而不是企业化的四组八位  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.32,0:05:26.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's what we should celebrate instead of corpo-quad-octets.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.08,0:05:29.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,说到这里 感谢各位观看  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.08,0:05:29.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And with that, thanks for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.82,0:05:30.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,保重
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.82,0:05:30.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:30.68,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1947.407,427.852)}原标题：Why your IP address is (probably) awesome  原作者：Enderman\N原视频上传日期：2025年8月26日
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:50.73,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur90\fad(200,200)\fscx185\fscy188\pos(1885.333,840)}在 Youtube 上关注
